			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["32D24E3C2D028686"]
			description: ["The &6MAX Machine Hull&r is the first thing every MAX machine needs. It is an assembly-line recipe from MAX casings, horizon strand cable and chain lamina stacks."]
