		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7C344D24CFB4563A"]
			description: ["Put the coordinates in the input bus of a ring that is holding and stand inside: it carries you to the orbit of Sagittarius A*. Step out of the platform's ring and back in to come home. Machines for the orbit start here."]
