		{
			dependencies: ["305F48FF31D86B06"]
			description: ["The platform's ring is a full warp gate, but it is your way home. Build a second &6Warp Gate&r at the orbit for the holds that leave from here: the belt seed's now, and the one that leaves the Galaxy later."]
