		{
			dependencies: ["17C4E15C613E47BA"]
			description: ["A seed for a belt of planetesimals at the centre. It is an assembly-line recipe researched with the cluster ephemeris, and it takes metal feedstock and sinter casing from the Cluster-Light Furnace line. The gate's hold here takes it with the launched probe."]
