		{
			dependencies: ["14F8810FFFD16F9C", "389ED54791286682"]
			description: ["The &6MAX Energy Input Hatch&r, its 16 A version, the &6MAX Input Bus&r and the &6MAX Battery&r are assembly-line recipes built on the MAX hull, with MAX sensors and circuits. With them in place the OpV pair you have been using can retire."]
