		{
			dependencies: ["35EE95AAB58E189A"]
			description: ["The &6Shell Gradient Map&r shows where on the shell the field is steepest, so the first segments go where they are needed. Once the shell stands, its second recipe joins this map to the spin map into the final spin map that the last recipe wants."]
