			title: "Three Quarters"
			x: 62.5d
			y: 18.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3AD1F00AD8DB5003"]
			description: ["The shell has 26 ports where light goes in and out and where the hatches sit. Each port is a cleanroom glass pane ringed by a loop of coil and membrane, which keeps the opening shielded and tuned. The ports stand on the faces, the edges and the corners of the box, in the same pattern as the Terminal's ghost. The 398 &6Shell Window Coil Casings&r of the shell, from the Sagittarius casings: two per batch. Place them first with the Terminal, then the glass. The glass ports and the closed shell. Run a dedicated line for the casing; its coil and membrane inputs come from the cold-metrology and membrane lines."]
			icon: "grindless:shell_window_coil_casing"
			id: "37ED184778035F51"
			rewards: [{ id: "13BD8B1027C6CF18", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ count: 398L, id: "52F95ED06A894AEB", item: "grindless:shell_window_coil_casing", type: "item" }]
			title: "Shell Window Coils"
			x: 57.5d
			y: 20.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["37ED184778035F51"]
			description: ["The panes of the 26 ports are &6Cleanroom Glass&r, the same glass as a cleanroom wall. They let the controller and the hatches see through the shell while the rest of it stays closed. The controller itself sits in the middle of the front port. 459 cleanroom glass blocks, set inside the rings of window coil casings: the Terminal places them in the same four passes as the segments. Hatches go in the two rows beside the controller. A shell that can form: the last segments close it. Glass is a common GTM block; keep a stack in ME and let the Terminal draw it."]
			icon: "gtceu:cleanroom_glass"
			id: "3DAAE5D7745BF778"
			rewards: [{ id: "1579F2E4E3E7AEC0", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ count: 64L, id: "123727EE3192F3FB", item: "gtceu:cleanroom_glass", type: "item" }]
			title: "Cleanroom Glass Ports"
			x: 60.0d
			y: 20.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["38EC1422CD925532", "3DAAE5D7745BF778"]
			description: ["Every segment is set and the last gap in the frame is closed. Check it off once the controller says the shell has formed."]
			icon: "grindless:mirror_shell_segment"
			id: "764F18E0B5749AFE"
			rewards: [{ id: "102D8F36795CFA36", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "106B0A8DEE039CEA", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "The Shell Is Closed"
			x: 65.0d
