			description: ["The &6Segment Reclamation Works&r strips an ablated shell segment into scrap streams. Nothing the shell wears out is thrown away. Ablated segments from the shell. The body is 2,379 blocks: 1,258 truss and 312 membrane vacuum casings among others, so the Terminal needs 2 passes. Scrap that goes back into the segment, cooler and coupler lines. Each scrap stream goes to its own line by bus."]
