		{
			dependencies: ["7690AA593CC7CD25"]
			description: ["The reclamation loop: ablated shell segments are stripped, bioleached and extracted back to YBCO precursor, so nothing is lost. In a &6Solvent Extraction&r: 4 Yttrium Oxide Dust, programmed circuit 30, nitric acid, water. The YBCO bulk of the bearing, without fresh rare earths. Return every ablated segment to the reclamation works."]
			icon: "grindless:ybco_precursor_powder"
