		}
		{
			dependencies: ["190860EE07AF5EA6"]
			description: ["The line that grows from the Si-28 qubit line: four tested tetron dies are bonded to a cryo photonic interposer, joined with squeezed light, cooled and shielded into the shielded quantum module. Three branches (squeezed-light chip, tweezer die, interposer) feed it. The &6TFLN Fab&r, &6Photonic Foundry&r, &6Millikelvin Cryostat Works&r, &6Membrane Line&r and &6Photonic Integration Hall&r in turn, with the tetron dies of the Si-28 line. The supracausal mainframe, the only circuit of MAX: 3 tweezer dies, 7 OpV circuits and the shielded module go into it. Every module step is slow and holds its machine, so give each its own. Stock the three branch parts by ME."]
			icon: "gtnn:supracausal_mainframe"
			id: "7BDFDAE56D37A306"
			rewards: [{ id: "537E0217AE99EF55", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
