			title: "M1: The Supracausal Stage"
			x: 76.0d
			y: 35.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7BDFDAE56D37A306"]
			description: ["Four tested tetron dies are bonded to a cryo photonic interposer. The tetron dies come from the Si-28 line and ten percent come back as failed dies. In a &6Ion Slicing&r: 4 Tested Tetron Die, a Cryo Photonic Interposer, programmed circuit 14. The photonic tetron module. Return failed dies to the Si-28 line."]
			icon: "grindless:transducer_bonded_stack"
