		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7FE4061C2A0C630B"]
			description: ["The module is cooled in the nuclear demagnetisation stage of the Millikelvin Cryostat Works, with a He-3/He-4 mixture that comes back. In a &6Nuclear Demagnetisation&r: a Photonic Tetron Module, a Mk Cryostat Module, programmed circuit 12, he3 he4 mixture. The shielded quantum module. The mixture is recovered: keep it in its own tank."]
			icon: "grindless:calibrated_photonic_module"
			id: "3EFF5EFBF9CE73CD"
