		{
			dependencies: ["3BF4D5302515D048"]
			description: ["Two rows meet in the archive. One writes the genomes the pack has met, from synthetic oligos to a xeno library; the other builds a minimal cell, hardens it and vitrifies it as the Ark capsule. The &6Biofoundry&r, &6Organoid Lab&r, &6Ark Biosphere&r and &6Xenobotany Greenhouse&r for the genomes; the &6Vent Bioreactor&r, &6Radiotrophic Vat&r and &6Aerogel Works&r for the capsule. The Gene Ark. Both rows feed one Gene Ark; a refill recipe re-uses it, so one archive is enough."]
			icon: "grindless:genome_archive"
			id: "5EE3599B681E1869"
			rewards: [{ id: "764C3EE1BE4331EB", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
