		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EE3599B681E1869"]
			description: ["The Biofoundry writes the oligos that both rows start from; they are the cheapest input of the archive. In a &6Sterile Culture&r: 2 Phosphorus Dust, programmed circuit 17, sterilized growth medium, ammonia. The genome set row and the minimal cell row. Pipe it to both rows."]
			icon: "grindless:synthetic_oligo_pool"
