		{
			dependencies: ["7372AB2A250B83C5"]
			description: ["The Ark Biosphere grows the genomes of the pack's own organisms from their extracts. In a &6Closed Ecosystem&r: a Organoid Genome Extract, a Algae Culture, programmed circuit 4, raw growth medium, water. The xeno genome set and the genome library. The extracts come by ME: keep the biosphere fed."]
			icon: "grindless:ark_genome_set"
