		{
			dependencies: ["553213C3B1F12E18"]
			description: ["A synthetic genome is transplanted into a bare mycoplasma cell in the Xenobiochemistry Plant. In a &6Xenobiochemistry&r: a Recipient Mycoplasma Culture, programmed circuit 5, sterilized growth medium, ultrapure water. The hardened cell and the vitrified capsule. The culture grows in the vent bioreactor: keep a spare."]
			icon: "grindless:transplanted_minimal_cell"
