		{
			dependencies: ["74AD149E2593C571"]
			description: ["The hardened cell is vitrified in aerogel: the capsule that the Ark carries. In a &6Supercritical Drying&r: a Hardened Minimal Cell, 2 Silica Aerogel, programmed circuit 6, ethanol, carbon dioxide. The genome archive. One capsule per archive."]
			icon: "grindless:vitrified_cell_capsule"
