		{
			dependencies: ["5EE3599B681E1869"]
			description: ["The spin of Sagittarius A* is read from its ring of light: a gold-coated SiC dish, a niobium SIS mixer, a photonic local oscillator and a cryogenic low-noise amplifier feed the photon ring imager. The &6SiC Fibre Plant&r and &6CVI Furnace&r for the dish, the &6BEUV Scanner&r for the diodes and junctions, the &6Millikelvin Cryostat Works&r and &6Helium Refrigerator&r for the cold stages. The Sgr A* spin map and the cluster charts. Four rows feed one imager: give each its own buffer chest and let the imager take what it needs."]
			icon: "grindless:sgr_a_spin_map"
			id: "38589D7BEFCC0FB6"
			rewards: [{ id: "729A793BEF2F7E40", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
