		{
			dependencies: ["77C6BBFCD61A97E6"]
			description: ["A niobium trilayer is patterned into SIS junctions, tested cold and packaged as the mixer that beats the signal down. In a &6Assembler&r: 2 Tested Sis Die, a MAX circuit, 2 Tritanium Plate, 4 Tritanium Foil, 2 Horizon Strand Single Wire, 2 Tritanium Round and more. The imager receivers. The test stage is the bottleneck; buffer in front of it."]
