		{
			dependencies: ["5501188234966912"]
			description: ["An indium phosphide photodiode that makes the local oscillator by light in the Photonic Foundry. In a &6Photonic Foundry&r: 2 Utc Die, a Glass Interposer, programmed circuit 24, ultrapure water, soldering alloy. The imager receivers. Make a few; they are not consumed."]
			icon: "grindless:photonic_lo_module"
