		{
			dependencies: ["38589D7BEFCC0FB6"]
			description: ["A mirror shell segment is a truss, a membrane, an albedo panel, a droplet radiator, a cryocooler, a controller, a Halbach coupler and a tunable impedance sheet. Most are made from the rock of the nuclear star cluster. The &6Cluster-Light Furnace&r, &6Carbonyl Refinery&r and &6Levitation Melter&r for the truss, the &6Nitride Magnet Works&r for the coupler, the &6Droplet Radiator Works&r, and the swarm-segment craft. The Mirror Shell, which is built from segments. Eight parts feed one craft: buffer each by ME. Spent segments come back through the reclamation works for their rare earths."]
			icon: "grindless:mirror_shell_segment"
			id: "7154D53F880CEAA8"
