		{
			dependencies: ["7154D53F880CEAA8"]
			description: ["The truss is cast from belt rock: bloom, carbonyl powder, alloy ingot and billet, ending in the Cluster-Light Furnace. In a &6Extruder&r: 2 Segment Truss Billet, a Rod Extruder Mold. The mirror shell segment. The furnace casts in bulk: buffer the truss."]
			icon: "grindless:segment_truss"
