			description: ["Cryo-milled iron cores are pressed into tetrataenite and made into a Halbach magnet array. In a &6Nitride Magnet Synthesis&r: 2 Cold Pressed Tetrataenite, a Fe16n2 Ring Magnet, programmed circuit 20, nitrogen. The mirror shell segment. Stock one per segment."]
			icon: "grindless:halbach_segment_coupler"
