		{
			dependencies: ["5868D58C915A51AE"]
			description: ["A pulse tube charged with Er3Ni spheres. Spent coolers are not binned: their erbium goes back through the reclamation works. In a &6Assembler&r: 2 Charged Pulse Tube, 2 Opv Electric Pump, a Opv Sensor, 2 Tungsten Steel Plate, 2 Gold Foil, 4 Niobium Titanium Foil and more. The segment and the shell's controller. Return scrap to the Segment Reclamation Works."]
