		{
			dependencies: ["5B5EFB6533ACCA23"]
			description: ["A nozzle plate and a collector shell are joined in the Droplet Radiator Works with a tin-lithium eutectic that sprays heat into space. In a &6Droplet Radiator Assembly&r: a Droplet Nozzle Plate, a Radiator Collector Shell, programmed circuit 5, sn li eutectic. The mirror shell segment. The eutectic is reused: keep it in its own loop."]
			icon: "grindless:shell_droplet_radiator"
