		{
			dependencies: ["79EED97851FABCE3"]
			description: ["A tantalum-hafnium carbide liner is sealed by CVI; it lines the Cluster-Light Furnace and wears out. In a &6Chemical Vapour Infiltration&r: a Ta Hf C Billet, programmed circuit 15, methane. The furnace. Keep spares: the hearth wears."]
			icon: "grindless:sealed_hearth_liner"
