			x: 78.5d
			y: 48.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["10EC59B617C0F47A"]
			description: ["A niobium driver cell, polished, coated with Nb3Sn and conduction-cooled. In a &6Assembler&r: 4 Conduction Cooled Cell, 2 Opv Electric Motor, a Opv Sensor, 2 Tungsten Steel Plate, 4 Niobium Titanium Foil, a OPV circuit and more. The horizon phase lock. The refrigerator is shared: queue the cells."]
			icon: "grindless:srf_driver_module"
			id: "1BAF76BF257AD477"
