			x: 81.0d
			y: 48.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1BAF76BF257AD477"]
			description: ["A thorium-229 nuclear clock steers an SRF cavity; its mode is cooled and fed to the Kugelblitz Forge. In a &6Kugelblitz Forming&r: a Cooled Cavity Mode, a Kugelblitz Seed, 2 Positron Cartridge, 2 Gamma Absorber Tile, programmed circuit 6. The horizon lock. Four are needed: queue them by pattern."]
			icon: "grindless:seed_wave_packet"
			id: "304BBB67F0919BE4"
			rewards: [{ id: "337F734D5675B6E9", type: "xp", xp: 60 }]
