			x: 83.5d
			y: 48.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["304BBB67F0919BE4"]
			description: ["A cooled flux pump is set in a frame with two chain field coils and two MAX circuits: the pump that charges the flux clamp. In a &6Assembler&r: programmed circuit 17, a Cold Flux Pump, 2 Tungsten Steel Plate, 4 Tungsten Steel Rod, 2 Tungsten Steel Ring, a Tungsten Steel Gear and more. The Horizon Flux Clamp. Its slow part is the cold flux pump: stock it by ME."]
			icon: "grindless:hts_flux_pump"
			id: "566472E6E2247BB3"
