			title: "Diamond Power Die"
			x: 76.0d
			y: 55.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["34BD327FE06C9C6B"]
			description: ["A closed fluid loop: hot flow plasma from the accretion disk is filtered, shaped into a flux-loaded plasmoid and run through a dynamo that leaves a cooled exhaust. The winding for its magnets is the first step. The &6Accretion Disk Skimmer&r, &6Plasma Mass Filter&r, &6FRC Former&r and &6BZ Dynamo&r. The Penrose payload, the Mh field casing and the Mh coil formers. Pipe the exhaust back to the skimmer: nothing is voided."]
			icon: "grindless:mh_winding"
			id: "1F9D5BC4001C3041"
			rewards: [{ id: "544EF9F3D29DB28B", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "39E0CDB0FA707B7D", item: "grindless:mh_winding", type: "item" }]
			title: "Sgr A* Power Loop"
			x: 76.0d
			y: 58.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1F9D5BC4001C3041"]
			description: ["Radioactive waste is retrieved, cooled in a decay-heat vault, vitrified in a hot cell and sealed: a destination for the era's hottest byproduct. The &6Waste Retrieval Plant&r, &6Decay Heat Vault&r and &6Hot Cell&r. The Geroch power recipe, which returns a spent tether segment. Pipe waste in from every plant that makes it; the canister leaves by ME."]
			icon: "grindless:geroch_canister"
			id: "14884E6E5042EC63"
			rewards: [{ id: "7DBE32DBE97B8DD3", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
