		{
			dependencies: ["1A591384C2EAD2DD"]
			description: ["A superconducting toroid that stores energy as current: a REBCO winding braced and cooled. The &6Coated Conductor Line&r, &6HTS Magnet Works&r, &6Naquadria Magnet Works&r and &6Helium Refrigerator&r. The MAX Battery and the MAX SMES cell. One per buffer: a short run, no stock needed."]
			icon: "grindless:cold_smes_toroid"
