		{
			dependencies: ["75B7B53E2E0F4E0A"]
			description: ["A silicon cavity with crystalline mirrors, held cold: the reference that a laser is stabilised against. The &6Crystal Growth Furnace&r, &6MBE Reactor&r and &6Helium Refrigerator&r. The matter wave gradiometer. Make a few, and keep the cooling loop running."]
			icon: "grindless:cryo_reference_cavity"
			id: "376A71FE67DE3634"
