		{
			dependencies: ["376A71FE67DE3634"]
			description: ["A fault-current limiter on a coated tape, wound into a coil and cooled: it protects the grid from a short. The &6Coated Conductor Line&r, &6HTS Magnet Works&r and &6Helium Refrigerator&r. The Horizon Flux Clamp, the MAX substation hatches and the MAX 1A energy converter. One per network: a short run."]
			icon: "grindless:cold_fcl_module"
