		{
			dependencies: ["1AD66AF318FC2D2F"]
			description: ["A laser-welded glass cell, annealed, coated and cold tested: the vessel a cold-atom experiment sits in. The &6Zone Refining Tower&r, &6Femtosecond Writer&r and &6Helium Refrigerator&r. The Rydberg Array Works. A few cells cover the era."]
			icon: "grindless:cold_qualified_cell"
